   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7b677ac7-559e-4d1b-8618-1227263bcb7e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Channel 1 is the blood vessels; viewing this component alone makes a 3D model in which color intensity is proportional to probability that a voxel is in a blood vessel.\n",
