   "id": "84ef8d30-d735-42cf-9bdf-8bc89377f3b0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The code below saves a rotating image as a short movie. Remember to set the movie's filename to properly represent `INPUT_FILENAME`."
   ]
