    "# Deep Sets Issue #120 — feature regimes\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook summarizes validation AUC when `metrics.json` is present under each experiment’s `train/` tree, lists point-feature columns for the registered configs, and documents how to launch the full build -> merge -> train pipeline on Slurm. When `validation_summary` is present, it also saves pooled overall vs HER2-enriched AUC bars and a subtype-by-arm heatmap under `analysis/figures/deepsets_issue120/`.\n"
   ]
  },
