        "## Decision checklist (Issue #121)\n",
        "\n",
        "Use this list when picking or rejecting a default **dataset-build** rule (downstream AUC is a separate study):\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Case coverage** — For fallback rules, `cases_skipped` should stay near zero. Compare `cases_written` to the cohort size implied by the build log.\n",
