        "## Interpreting the default-rule check\n",
        "\n",
        "The final block prints the same summary as a compact table and highlights the\n",
        "default against `local_radius_only` plus the fixed-radius and peritumoral-shell\n",
        "variants. The pinned decision record lives in\n",
        "[`docs/deepsets_issue121_inclusion_rules.md`](../docs/deepsets_issue121_inclusion_rules.md).\n",
        "\n",
        "Use it as a consistency check, not a full model-selection study.\n",
        "\n",
        "- Prefer a default that keeps case coverage high without leaning on fallback.\n",
        "- Treat `local_radius_only` skips as the cost of removing fallback.\n",
        "- Compare fixed 30 mm, fixed 50 mm, and peritumoral shells on fallback fraction\n",
        "  and median point counts relative to the tumor-relative default.\n",
        "- Treat the fixture summary as a smoke test and the cohort summary as the\n",
        "  decision-quality view when available."
